<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 5,098 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 1,000 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  152   (131 and 161)</p>
<p>    Good		122   (122 and 140)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     114   (114 and 122)</p>
<p>    Medium	    104   (103 and 104)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 88   ( 90 and  90)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 152 pence for a Burundi BP1.</p>
</text>
